		(property "Note" "Hears the phone through its back: the far side of a call. On the microphones' rail, so the switch and the light govern it too. Shares data line 1 with microphone A, on the other clock edge: SELECT levels to confirm. Pin numbers are the evaluation flex's, not the package's. 290 uA at this clock. Needs a firm path to the back skin: a pad of adhesive between its lid and the skin" (at 76.20 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
